{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261026/photo/bkn-20261026164602608-1026_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261026194917\"/><p>私煙被搬上岸。</p><p>今午(26日)12時50分，長洲東灣泳灘職員報案，指有多個內有香煙的可疑箱子被浪沖上沙灘。警員接報到場共檢獲21個箱子，懷疑箱內的香煙均為未完稅的私煙，案件轉交海關跟進。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T12:00:37.267731+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":101,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T08:46:02+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T12:58:06.669105+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T11:58:11.537062+00:00","content_hash":"930f732ed0a51168e2f575dd39bc3f1559052946f53d4829875542b19c82e484","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-26T12:00:37.267731+00:00","latest_fallback":"minimal","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}